mapt (0.1.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Separate the body of a dialog from its key hints with a horizontal
    rule.  The hint line used to sit on the last row of the text, so the
    last visible line of the Info window was never readable.

 -- APPIT Adam Skowroński <info@appit.pl>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 11:40:00 +0200

mapt (0.1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Open the details window without waiting for apt-cache.  F3 used to run
    three apt-cache queries between the keypress and the window; the
    dependency list is now taken from the answer the panel prefetch already
    has, and the whole text is built while the screen is idle.  Pressing Esc
    while the window was still being prepared was silently swallowed.

 -- APPIT Adam Skowroński <info@appit.pl>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 11:05:00 +0200

mapt (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix a stale drop shadow: closing a popup and opening the next one
    without an intervening full redraw left the black shadow of the closed
    window on screen (for example File > Info, or Find... followed by an
    alert).  ui_shadow now saves the cells it covers and ui_unshadow
    restores them when the window is destroyed.

 -- APPIT Adam Skowroński <info@appit.pl>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 09:05:35 +0200

mapt (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package.

 -- APPIT Adam Skowroński <info@appit.pl>  Fri, 25 Sep 2026 14:00:00 +0000
